        <mxCell id="v14" value="Case actions are not lifecycle event types: each is written to the hash-chained audit_log (FR-M-05) and the case row keeps the current status. The decision itself becomes a lifecycle event (C06 &amp;#8594; dispute_resolved T25, hold_cleared T09&amp;#8211;T11 or request_declined T12). &lt;b&gt;it.2&lt;/b&gt;: appeal and reversal are designed here but built in iteration 2 (Iteration 1 plan, Module 9)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10.5;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#33404D;spacing=2;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1">
